gomad: separate capability collection, pure evaluation and linked projection
Collection owns every host effect of a capability review, including
compatibility pack loading. The new target/internal/capabilitypolicy
package evaluates the collected evidence against the existing
compatibility policy without touching the host. Linked projection reads
and narrows the embedded capability record. Adapter source-inventory
hashing moves to the neutral internal/sourceinventory package, which
target and deterministicio both consume. target no longer exports
DigestAdapterSourceInventory.

Golden canonical reviews captured before the change stay byte-identical,
and the architecture tests now enforce the evaluator's purity and the
new owner.

